#~ "diagonal direction). Note that `AXIS=dx,dy` and `AXIS=-dx,-dy` is equivalent. "
#~ "`adxl345_chip_name` can be one or more configured adxl345 chip,delimited with "
#~ "comma, for example `CHIPS=\"adxl345, adxl345 rpi\"`. Note that `adxl345` can "
